        "docs/protocols/spec-studio/specifications.md:15"
      ],
      "statement": "Both protocol authorities describe CRDT deltas sealed with a per-epoch group key derived through MLS, the R4 form that ADR-0048 retires. Both files are pinned by sha256 in contracts/protocol-authorities.v1.json, so this record does not edit them: their correction is an amendment of a pinned protocol authority, outside ADR-0048's authorization.",
